<title>FRANCE: BNP first half net attrib profit rises.</title>
<headline>BNP first half net attrib profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end June 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   1,735  vs	     966</p>
<p>    Net					    1,844  vs	   1,056</p>
<p>    Operating				    5,119  vs	   4,366</p>
<p>    Net banking income			19,223  vs	  18,334</p>
<p>    Net new provisions			 2,459  vs	   2,818</p>
<p>    Operating costs			   14,104  vs	  13,968</p>
<p>NOTE - Banque Nationale de Paris released the results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
